{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/3b0fa8d49dc50b56d5c1f7778a04eaea.poster.avif?t=1770367546\" width=640 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/3b0fa8d49dc50b56d5c1f7778a04eaea.webm?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/3b0fa8d49dc50b56d5c1f7778a04eaea.mp4?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Kind of Puzzle Using Rotation and Gravity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the core of SPACE REVOLVER is a unique map-rotation mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment the map rotates, the direction of gravity changes, causing the player and all objects to fall toward the new \u201cdown.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a single rotation, the solution to a puzzle can change completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fresh way of solving puzzles by literally approaching them from every angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/60ac2e6f60583fc975244628c67070c1.poster.avif?t=1770367546\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/60ac2e6f60583fc975244628c67070c1.webm?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/60ac2e6f60583fc975244628c67070c1.mp4?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flexible Thinking Through Diverse Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the stages, new devices and rules are introduced, constantly expanding the way you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map rotation is only the beginning. Use every object and mechanism on the map to discover the smartest way to solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/2184f9bf1624e005699b0c5e0464a78e.poster.avif?t=1770367546\" width=636 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/2184f9bf1624e005699b0c5e0464a78e.webm?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/2184f9bf1624e005699b0c5e0464a78e.mp4?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Space Adventure That Begins in the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded in the depths of space, there is only one way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore nearby planets, solve the puzzles, and collect energy to repair your damaged spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From frozen worlds to planets with unstable gravity and electrically charged environments,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you must navigate each unique planet and gather the energy you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/575390d6b86d47acb8a4611f772afe25.poster.avif?t=1770367546\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/575390d6b86d47acb8a4611f772afe25.webm?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/575390d6b86d47acb8a4611f772afe25.mp4?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey with Cute Pixel Art Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, even in the vastness of space, you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adorable helper robot, RoVo, accompanies you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy charming pixel art characters and beautifully themed planetary environments that bring the world of SPACE REVOLVER to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gravity and Rotation Puzzles: A grid-based puzzle system enhanced with gravity and map rotation mechanics, demanding a completely new way of thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy to learn, Hard to Master:\u00a0Solve every puzzle using just five simple controls: left, right, map rotation, and gravity manipulation. Simple on the surface, endlessly deep in practice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Diverse Mechanics and Stages: Over 200 puzzle stages featuring boxes, switches, map rotation, gravity shifts, ice, conveyor belts, and many more interactive elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cute Characters and Memorable Moments: Small interactions with your helper robot RoVo make the adventure even more special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Energy Collection: Gather scattered energy hidden throughout each planet to repair your broken spaceship. Can you find them all?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745860?t=1770367546","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/9909656da56cb3aaa596cead42597535f5890eb2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770367546","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/60c1a07cab3cae99b8ae5003c86aaa14a7944a7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770367546","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/60c1a07cab3cae99b8ae5003c86aaa14a7944a7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770367546","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3779730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/3b0fa8d49dc50b56d5c1f7778a04eaea.poster.avif?t=1770367546\" width=640 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/3b0fa8d49dc50b56d5c1f7778a04eaea.webm?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/3b0fa8d49dc50b56d5c1f7778a04eaea.mp4?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Kind of Puzzle Using Rotation and Gravity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the core of SPACE REVOLVER is a unique map-rotation mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment the map rotates, the direction of gravity changes, causing the player and all objects to fall toward the new \u201cdown.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a single rotation, the solution to a puzzle can change completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fresh way of solving puzzles by literally approaching them from every angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/60ac2e6f60583fc975244628c67070c1.poster.avif?t=1770367546\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/60ac2e6f60583fc975244628c67070c1.webm?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/60ac2e6f60583fc975244628c67070c1.mp4?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flexible Thinking Through Diverse Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the stages, new devices and rules are introduced, constantly expanding the way you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map rotation is only the beginning. Use every object and mechanism on the map to discover the smartest way to solve each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/2184f9bf1624e005699b0c5e0464a78e.poster.avif?t=1770367546\" width=636 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/2184f9bf1624e005699b0c5e0464a78e.webm?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/2184f9bf1624e005699b0c5e0464a78e.mp4?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Space Adventure That Begins in the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded in the depths of space, there is only one way home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore nearby planets, solve the puzzles, and collect energy to repair your damaged spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From frozen worlds to planets with unstable gravity and electrically charged environments,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you must navigate each unique planet and gather the energy you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/575390d6b86d47acb8a4611f772afe25.poster.avif?t=1770367546\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/575390d6b86d47acb8a4611f772afe25.webm?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/extras/575390d6b86d47acb8a4611f772afe25.mp4?t=1770367546\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey with Cute Pixel Art Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, even in the vastness of space, you are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adorable helper robot, RoVo, accompanies you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy charming pixel art characters and beautifully themed planetary environments that bring the world of SPACE REVOLVER to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gravity and Rotation Puzzles: A grid-based puzzle system enhanced with gravity and map rotation mechanics, demanding a completely new way of thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy to learn, Hard to Master:\u00a0Solve every puzzle using just five simple controls: left, right, map rotation, and gravity manipulation. Simple on the surface, endlessly deep in practice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Diverse Mechanics and Stages: Over 200 puzzle stages featuring boxes, switches, map rotation, gravity shifts, ice, conveyor belts, and many more interactive elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cute Characters and Memorable Moments: Small interactions with your helper robot RoVo make the adventure even more special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Energy Collection: Gather scattered energy hidden throughout each planet to repair your broken spaceship. Can you find them all?</p>","developers":["MKstudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745860/cca599c7df2f899489b116a454efe861cf0d832a/header.jpg?t=1770367546","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3745860/880014112/75e20a39904e4531770a00912c7da6f9fe6a9aad/1758300543/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758300821","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3745860/880014112/75e20a39904e4531770a00912c7da6f9fe6a9aad/1758300543/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758300821","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3745860/880014112/75e20a39904e4531770a00912c7da6f9fe6a9aad/1758300543/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758300821","id":257202319,"name":"SPACE REVOLVER Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257202319/982410f73199b339aedbf3a0ba7506694c4e975a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758300821"},{"dash_a